N2  - This presentation on caesarean scar niches and uterine synechiae will discuss why some women develop a niche, and what the potential consequences can be (including caesarean scar pregnancy, placenta accreta spectrium, subfertility and irregular menstrual bleeding). It will also discuss uterine synechiae or Asherman's syndrome. There will be 2D and 3D images as well as video clips of 'As Live' ultrasound examinations.
