N2  - Introduction: Surgical video of Hysteroscopic Repair of Isthmocele with Myometrial Cysts. Objective: To show the safe and effective surgical technique for Hysteroscopic Repair of Isthmocele with Myometrial Cysts. Methods: Surgical Video. Results: Safely completed repair of hysteroscopic repair of isthmocele with myometrial cysts. Conclusions: Hysteroscopic repair of the isthmocele can be safely accomplished, and it is associated with improvements in outcomes, in cases of secondary infertility or abnormal uterine bleeding. Disclosure: No.
